      <activity id="2d7f9f68-19f7-5cc0-8b01-b120e504755d" activityNameId="34e348b0-619d-5a8a-884c-cc8506fc5c6a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Array cable, 66kV, offshore wind farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Array cable, 66kV, offshore wind farm
UUID=ab395015-4576-3804-b11e-4c69b2a48fe5
Average 66kV array cable for 740 MW offshore wind farm.
Included processes: manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement.
Data are based on the IEA reference offshore wind farm, consisting of 74 wind turbines with a nominal capacity of 10 MW in a irregular layout.

Main data source: 
Kainz, S. (2025). Life Cycle Inventory of the IEA Wind 740-10-MW Reference Offshore Wind Plant with irregular layout [Dataset]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/ZENODO.15880601
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ab395015-4576-3804-b11e-4c69b2a48fe5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
